# Packaging artefacts (Epic K3b): the herdr plugin and the
# agent skill ship in the sdist alongside the engine, so the
# documented `herdr plugin link` route works from an unpacked
# sdist as well as from a clone.
graft herdr-plugin-codereview
graft skills
# D-003 (external Phase 0–1 report, 2026-11-06): the sdist
# must be able to run its own test suite. Ship everything the
# suite reads: the full tests tree (fixtures included), the
# probe definitions, the public benchmark corpus, the examples,
# and the top-level data/docs files tests and tooling load.
# bench/ as a whole is NOT grafted — only bench/corpus; the
# registered run material (sealed sets, generation caches,
# confirmation records) stays out of the distribution.
graft tests
graft probes
graft bench/corpus
graft examples
include CHANGELOG.md precedents.json fixtures-manifest.json THREAT-MODEL.md
